      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1904-04-30_WidnesExaminer_art0036" n="art0036">
        <head>DIABETES AND CONSUMPTION</head>
        <p>DIABETES AND CONSUMPTION</p>
        <p>Every case completely Cured in two months without leaving home. The causes of these complaints have been discovered by MR.•SPARKS, SPECIALIST, 35 WAKE- FIELD ROAD, S rALYBRIDGE, and they can be cured sooner andsafer by his treatment than any other. Every case of arimmia and general weakness cured no matter who you have been under. Mr. Sparks knows more about the cure of cousumption than any other known man.</p>
