        <p>NOTICE TO CORRESPONDENTS.</p>
        <p>Authors of letters intended for publication must mall cases send their names and addresses to the Editor as a guarantee of good faith. Matter intended for publication must be written on one *Ws only of the paper and Witt in, if possible,not Later than Thursday.</p>
