        <p>Marriage. MARSHALL—NOLLAND.—On the 27th inst at Holl Trinity, Warrington, by the Rev. A. Inglis, Archibald, third son of John Marshall, of Wakefield, to Leonora, daughter of Robert Noland, of Warrington. PEERS-ROSCOE-April 23rd, at the Parish Church, - Warrington, by the Rev. A. S. Cameron, Peter Peers, ,to Nancy Roscoe. Death. --- Bu LEY.-April 25th, at 162' Liverpool-road, War-4 rington, Margaret, widow of the late James Bailey' aged 81. No cards. ,</p>
